Package: tux-wallpaper
Version: 0.1.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3-vlc (>= 3.0), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo,
         gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0,
         gir1.2-wnck-3.0, python3-pydbus, python3-setproctitle
Maintainer: Dean <dean@example.com>
Description: Video wallpaper player for Linux (GTK3 + VLC)
 Tux Wallpaper plays video files as desktop wallpaper on Linux.
 It uses GTK3 for window embedding and VLC for video playback,
 providing a D-Bus interface for external control.
 .
 Features:
  * Multi-monitor support
  * Screen lock detection
  * Window state detection
  * Volume fade in/out
  * D-Bus control interface
